    "text": "Huntsville\nHuntsville to showcase greenway expansion to link downtown to Alabama A&M\n3 hours ago\nHUNTSVILLE, Ala. — The city of Huntsville is moving forward with a major expansion of its greenway system that will stretch from downtown to Alabama A&M University, and wants you to learn more about it. The expanded Meek Greenway will add connections to the upcoming skybridge and existing greenway...\n1",
